  "short_description": "NEIGHBORS: Suburban Warfare 是一款輕鬆愉快的團隊 PvP 遊戲，主題是社群戰爭！ 設下陷阱和路障來防禦你的房子。 制定策略並收集附近資源來獲得超棒物品，打敗你的鄰居！",
  "short_description_en": "Neighbors: Suburban Warfare is a chaotic online multiplayer party brawler where suburban rivals go to war. Team up with friends in wild PvE and PvP matches, destroy rival houses with everyday items turned weapons, and defend your home using traps, gadgets, and crazy team combos.",
